18:44.400 --> 18:48.712
...trying to fill the empty space
in myself by, you know...

18:49.200 --> 18:51.430
Filling the empty space in others.

18:51.920 --> 18:53.148
Exactly.

18:53.320 --> 18:55.151
That's quite an insight.

18:55.320 --> 18:57.550
Well, I'm deep in therapy now.

18:58.000 --> 18:59.479
You went for one hour, Charlie.

19:00.040 --> 19:03.191
Fifty minutes. It's kind of a racket.

19:03.920 --> 19:07.595
But the point is, I've hit bottom.

19:07.760 --> 19:09.830
I can't keep going like this.

19:10.000 --> 19:12.355
- It's time for me to grow up.
- I agree.

19:12.520 --> 19:14.829
So, what are you gonna do?

19:15.800 --> 19:19.031
Well, I thought I'd find some chick
with a big heart and a tiny ass...

19:19.200 --> 19:20.599
...and marry her.

19:22.480 --> 19:25.438
Maybe that girl from the beach.
She seemed nice.

19:26.240 --> 19:28.071
- You're going to get married?
- Yep.

19:28.240 --> 19:32.313
Settle down, have a couple of kids
and ship the penis up to Cooperstown.

19:33.480 --> 19:34.515
Cooperstown?

19:35.120 --> 19:36.758
It is my bat.

19:37.840 --> 19:40.434
Well, sounds like you've got
everything figured out.

19:41.040 --> 19:43.838
You don't ever
figure this stuff out, Alan.

19:44.000 --> 19:48.198
You just take little baby steps on a
lifelong path to becoming a better man.

19:50.800 --> 19:52.392
How many pain pills have you taken?

19:53.040 --> 19:54.268
Nine.

19:55.800 --> 19:57.199
Good night.

19:59.280 --> 20:01.714
Might not be a bad idea
to check on me in an hour or so.

20:01.880 --> 20:05.190
- Make sure I'm still breathing.
- I always do.

20:18.400 --> 20:19.913
Mia.

20:25.360 --> 20:27.078
My balls.

20:51.960 --> 20:53.951
Subtitles by
SDI Media Group

20:54.120 --> 20:56.111
[ENGLISH]
